Most of them will run if the kernel has ECOFF support enabled and you
install the tru64 shared libraries.  These can (could?) be downloaded
for free, or copied from a tru64 system should you have one.  Some
programs will not work, most notably those using pthreads.  Some
ioctls are also incompatible, for example a few specialized network
related ones.

