The other distribution that's being actively maintained for the Alpha is
Gentoo. It has a couple of advantages, and a couple of disadvantages,
relative to Debian:
Advantages:
1) Not a slave to RMS.
2) You can build everything optimized for your specific hardware.
Disadvantages:
